WEBVTT

01:38.110 --> 01:41.050
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.120 --> 01:44.000
[Episode 6]

01:44.400 --> 01:45.560
Today, I'm

01:45.680 --> 01:47.470
shamelessly

01:47.789 --> 01:49.000
asking you

01:50.200 --> 01:51.509
to help me for another two years.

01:52.200 --> 01:52.710
Is that alright?

01:53.229 --> 01:53.680
I understand.

01:54.030 --> 01:54.950
I completely understand.

01:55.840 --> 01:56.870
When you first came

01:56.920 --> 01:58.200
to the dance troupe,

01:58.280 --> 01:59.710
it was already settled.

01:59.920 --> 02:01.310
The contract was only for five years.

02:01.310 --> 02:03.230
After five years, you could come and go freely.

02:03.250 --> 02:04.730
I remember it all.

02:05.120 --> 02:05.950
But now,

02:06.070 --> 02:07.710
I really have no other choice.

02:12.120 --> 02:12.750
Ji Li,

02:13.360 --> 02:14.030
listen.

02:14.310 --> 02:15.150
Given our

02:15.470 --> 02:16.750
5 years of friendship,

02:17.470 --> 02:18.910
you can't walk away now.

02:19.000 --> 02:19.960
Leaving at a time like this

02:20.120 --> 02:21.630
would be like bringing down everything I've built.

02:21.990 --> 02:23.390
We should work together

02:23.470 --> 02:25.680
to help the Yunmen Dance Troupe through this difficult time,

02:25.870 --> 02:26.470
shouldn't we?

02:27.840 --> 02:28.280
Sir,

02:28.630 --> 02:29.070
I...

02:29.150 --> 02:29.720
Miss,

02:30.190 --> 02:30.840
please.

02:34.520 --> 02:35.240
Let me think about it.

02:35.630 --> 02:36.280
Alright.

02:37.750 --> 02:38.150
Come on.

02:38.170 --> 02:39.010
Let's have some tea.

02:39.680 --> 02:41.150
When a bronze mirror gathers spirit and transforms into a demon,

02:41.360 --> 02:42.400
its essence becomes cold and desolate.

02:42.810 --> 02:44.280
The demon's form is an ethereal illusion,

02:44.400 --> 02:45.710
existing in the space between yin and yang.

02:46.120 --> 02:46.870
This is why it can traverse

02:46.870 --> 02:48.750
into the mirror world with its innate powers.

02:49.310 --> 02:51.400
To sever the path of the Mirror Demon's comings and goings,

02:51.680 --> 02:53.810
the first step is to remove all reflective objects

02:53.840 --> 02:54.870
in the vicinity.

02:56.750 --> 02:57.430
Have you finished reading?

02:58.870 --> 02:59.280
I've...

02:59.320 --> 03:00.600
I've only read a few lines.

03:01.560 --> 03:02.560
Can't you recite it quietly?

03:09.120 --> 03:09.810
Be gentle.

03:09.840 --> 03:11.470
I still need to return the things I borrowed.

03:12.310 --> 03:13.080
Except for the bedroom,

03:13.280 --> 03:14.120
all the mirrors in the house

03:14.150 --> 03:14.630
are right here.

03:15.910 --> 03:16.520
Pack them up.

03:26.840 --> 03:27.240
Xuanye,

03:28.070 --> 03:30.120
I understand you can't do it in your house,

03:31.120 --> 03:33.750
but our ambush is across the street.

03:34.070 --> 03:35.310
Isn't it a bit far?

03:36.430 --> 03:37.370
If it catches the scent

03:37.400 --> 03:38.630
of the demon hunter,

03:38.870 --> 03:40.000
it definitely won't dare to come.

03:41.360 --> 03:41.960
Yes.

03:42.520 --> 03:42.910
But,

03:43.360 --> 03:44.430
what if...

03:44.430 --> 03:45.400
There's no "what if."

03:47.000 --> 03:48.310
I won't let her get into trouble.

04:04.430 --> 04:04.960
The lamp is lit.

05:05.160 --> 05:06.680
The first watch of the night,

05:07.360 --> 05:09.000
the moon hangs low.

05:09.680 --> 05:13.310
Pear Fairy, heed my humble plea.

05:13.950 --> 05:17.120
It's not that wealth has dimmed my eyes,

05:17.680 --> 05:20.800
nor do I yearn for a fine marriage.

05:21.680 --> 05:23.160
The second watch of the night,

05:24.120 --> 05:25.510
the moonlight chills the air.

05:26.310 --> 05:29.390
Pear Fairy steps into my garden.

05:31.150 --> 05:35.560
It's not to sigh before the mirror,

05:36.120 --> 05:38.870
nor to foolishly beg for longer years.

05:39.600 --> 05:41.120
The third watch of the night,

05:41.560 --> 05:42.600
the moon lingers late.

05:43.430 --> 05:46.040
Pear Fairy, may your ear attend my wish:

05:46.830 --> 05:48.830
First, let the flowers bloom once more.

05:49.480 --> 05:51.510
I'll face life and death without regret.

05:53.480 --> 05:55.720
Second, let my blood and bones be spent,

05:56.070 --> 05:58.490
just to reclaim my youthful days.

06:03.090 --> 06:03.810
It's broken.

06:23.600 --> 06:24.190
Pear...

06:52.190 --> 06:53.120
No need to search anymore.

06:54.150 --> 06:55.630
This room only has one mirror.

07:59.480 --> 08:00.160
The water...

08:00.870 --> 08:01.870
The surface of the water is also a mirror.

08:02.950 --> 08:03.680
We miscalculated.

08:14.270 --> 08:14.940
Today,

08:15.190 --> 08:16.310
can you not return to the dance troupe?

08:17.870 --> 08:18.800
No.

08:18.890 --> 08:21.250
Where there are many idle people, there are many rumors.

08:21.830 --> 08:23.120
If I don't go back,

08:23.390 --> 08:24.480
they'll start gossiping about me.

08:26.870 --> 08:27.390
What?

08:28.000 --> 08:29.000
You can't bear to leave me?

08:30.290 --> 08:33.539
[Zhou Jingyuan]

08:31.720 --> 08:33.770
I wish we could be together every day.

08:36.159 --> 08:37.710
Then marry me.

08:42.630 --> 08:43.549
Just kidding.

08:43.980 --> 08:44.940
Don't take it seriously.

08:45.640 --> 08:46.910
Li, I...

08:46.940 --> 08:48.070
With my humble background,

08:49.320 --> 08:50.480
how could I possibly be worthy of you?

08:52.080 --> 08:53.000
I know that deep down.

09:00.670 --> 09:01.840
What are you saying, Li?

09:04.550 --> 09:05.080
Alright.

09:05.630 --> 09:06.600
I won't hide it from you any longer.

09:07.750 --> 09:08.750
I've already told my mother

09:09.240 --> 09:10.270
about us.

09:15.440 --> 09:15.870
She...

09:17.670 --> 09:18.550
What did she say?

09:19.080 --> 09:20.080
She told me to marry you.

09:22.600 --> 09:23.670
How could that be?

09:24.790 --> 09:25.670
Actually, my mother's situation

09:25.670 --> 09:26.600
is quite similar to yours.

09:27.560 --> 09:29.220
Before she married my father as a concubine,

09:29.520 --> 09:30.320
she was a singer.

09:33.390 --> 09:34.630
My mother wanted me to make things clear with you.

09:35.600 --> 09:36.910
As an illegitimate child,

09:37.200 --> 09:38.770
it's impossible for me to inherit the family business.

09:39.080 --> 09:41.150
A life of wealth and glory

09:41.240 --> 09:42.000
is unlikely to happen.

09:42.960 --> 09:44.150
But if you're still willing to marry me,

09:44.740 --> 09:46.270
she'll take care of things with my father and grandfather.

09:46.840 --> 09:47.660
I promise,

09:48.200 --> 09:49.800
I'll marry you with full ceremony.

09:53.600 --> 09:54.120
Li,

09:54.790 --> 09:55.750
I want to marry you.

09:57.030 --> 09:58.390
Will you marry me?

10:19.800 --> 10:20.560
Why are you here?

10:23.390 --> 10:24.480
I've hit a dead end.

10:26.960 --> 10:28.240
But you can't come here.

10:28.560 --> 10:30.050
Didn't we agree before?

10:36.670 --> 10:37.550
I just want to rest for a while.

10:39.840 --> 10:40.480
Li,

10:41.870 --> 10:43.150
I've already exposed myself.

10:45.390 --> 10:46.600
We can't stay

10:47.440 --> 10:48.670
in Guangping anymore.

10:50.150 --> 10:51.000
Where shall we go this time?

10:53.960 --> 10:54.670
The northwest,

10:55.090 --> 10:55.760
Nanyang,

10:56.080 --> 10:56.670
Beiyan,

10:57.720 --> 10:58.480
anywhere is fine.

10:59.550 --> 11:00.790
Didn't we agree

11:01.480 --> 11:03.550
to change locations every five years?

11:04.960 --> 11:05.790
Where do you want to go?

11:06.790 --> 11:07.630
Anywhere is fine with me.

11:08.600 --> 11:09.630
Then I'll make the arrangements.

11:12.030 --> 11:14.390
You need to take care of the dance troupe matters.

11:16.250 --> 11:18.250
Have you talked to the troupe leader?

11:23.440 --> 11:24.160
Li.

11:25.390 --> 11:26.000
Not yet.

11:27.540 --> 11:28.390
I haven't seen the leader

11:28.670 --> 11:29.790
these past few days.

11:34.200 --> 11:34.630
Li,

11:35.630 --> 11:37.720
before we leave, everything needs to be settled properly.

11:38.120 --> 11:39.200
We can't afford to raise any suspicions.

11:39.390 --> 11:39.960
Understood?

11:40.510 --> 11:41.320
In all these years,

11:41.630 --> 11:42.480
this is the first time

11:42.480 --> 11:43.120
I've seen you this nervous.

11:47.230 --> 11:48.110
I must

11:48.750 --> 11:49.790
get my revenge.

11:51.240 --> 11:52.870
I'll make him pay double.

11:53.440 --> 11:54.480
Let's settle everything before we leave.

11:55.200 --> 11:56.270
We'll leave right after that.

12:09.150 --> 12:09.600
My Lady,

12:09.750 --> 12:10.240
what's wrong?

12:11.200 --> 12:11.720
My Lady,

12:12.630 --> 12:13.240
what's wrong?

12:14.870 --> 12:16.510
Tell him to remove the mirrors at once.

12:17.150 --> 12:17.630
Miss,

12:18.120 --> 12:19.810
these are all fine-quality bronze.

12:19.840 --> 12:20.910
Are you sure you don't want any of them?

12:21.840 --> 12:22.360
I don't want them.

12:23.580 --> 12:25.820
But these bronze items are of superior craftsmanship,

12:25.950 --> 12:26.820
and quite costly as well.

12:27.360 --> 12:28.580
Would you prefer wealth or your life?

12:30.840 --> 12:32.360
Then how will we do our makeup later?

12:33.320 --> 12:34.320
We won't do makeup anymore.

12:35.870 --> 12:36.360
Fine.

12:38.480 --> 12:39.120
Alright,

12:39.160 --> 12:40.760
I shall take these to the carriage first.

12:41.360 --> 12:42.550
We'll settle the payment at the door.

12:45.370 --> 12:46.000
My Lady,

12:46.360 --> 12:47.360
I'll go settle the bill.

12:47.600 --> 12:49.120
I steamed some buns in the kitchen.

12:49.140 --> 12:50.070
You should have some.

12:50.630 --> 12:51.080
Alright.

13:02.790 --> 13:03.390
Wait a moment.

13:03.670 --> 13:04.150
I'll

13:04.750 --> 13:05.840
go get something first.

13:05.870 --> 13:06.600
You calculate the amount.

13:07.240 --> 13:07.630
Alright,

13:07.650 --> 13:08.380
I'll calculate it.

13:39.590 --> 13:40.360
Tingzhou.

13:50.120 --> 13:50.910
You haven't left yet?

13:51.150 --> 13:52.710
Have you seen my maid?

13:57.120 --> 13:57.600
Miss,

13:58.030 --> 13:58.720
have a pear.

13:59.390 --> 13:59.840
Try it.

14:00.150 --> 14:00.840
It's very sweet.

14:09.440 --> 14:10.080
Xuanye!

14:10.360 --> 14:10.980
Chi Xue!

14:11.080 --> 14:11.720
Xuanye!

14:12.270 --> 14:12.840
Miss,

14:14.000 --> 14:14.750
have a pear.

14:15.320 --> 14:15.960
Have a pear.

14:33.890 --> 14:34.680
Miss,

14:36.480 --> 14:37.440
are you alright?

14:38.360 --> 14:38.910
Sis,

14:39.240 --> 14:40.520
have a pear.

14:40.540 --> 14:41.260
Have a pear.

15:34.630 --> 15:35.550
You can't escape this.

15:37.270 --> 15:38.000
Whether you want to or not,

15:38.670 --> 15:39.600
you'll have to

15:40.210 --> 15:41.330
eat this pear.

16:37.200 --> 16:39.000
Come, take a look! Have a peek!

16:39.020 --> 16:40.570
Charms and trinkets!

16:41.240 --> 16:42.120
Come and see!

16:45.510 --> 16:47.120
Come, have a look! Take a peek!

16:47.310 --> 16:48.910
Charms and trinkets!

16:51.580 --> 16:52.340
Xuanye.

16:57.150 --> 16:57.840
Banxia!

16:58.270 --> 16:58.910
Banxia!

17:30.110 --> 17:30.880
Physician Jiu,

17:31.920 --> 17:33.270
what happened to my lady?

17:33.880 --> 17:34.960
She's been frightened.

17:35.200 --> 17:35.960
She needs to rest.

17:37.240 --> 17:38.480
Do you have any calming medicine at home?

17:38.630 --> 17:39.830
Brew a dose for her to take.

17:40.960 --> 17:42.480
Alright, I'll go prepare it right away.

17:43.590 --> 17:44.030
By the way,

17:45.440 --> 17:46.550
her clothes are all wet.

17:46.750 --> 17:47.800
Change her into some dry clothes

17:48.000 --> 17:49.000
to prevent her from catching a cold.

17:49.060 --> 17:49.510
Got it.

17:53.400 --> 17:54.070
Physician Jiu,

17:55.160 --> 17:56.400
my lady needs to change her clothes.

17:59.590 --> 18:00.680
I'll wait outside then.

18:00.790 --> 18:01.640
If you need anything,

18:01.660 --> 18:02.340
call me anytime.

18:03.000 --> 18:03.350
Alright.

18:46.200 --> 18:47.010
My Lady,

18:47.350 --> 18:48.350
you're awake.

18:51.310 --> 18:51.920
My Lady.

18:52.310 --> 18:53.550
What's wrong, My Lady?

18:57.720 --> 18:58.310
Tingzhou,

19:02.640 --> 19:03.480
do you have any pears?

19:04.720 --> 19:05.400
Pears?

19:08.060 --> 19:09.440
Do you want to have a pear, My Lady?

19:11.740 --> 19:12.640
Do you have any?

19:13.960 --> 19:14.830
My Lady.

19:16.440 --> 19:17.110
My Lady.

19:18.310 --> 19:19.350
What's really wrong with you?

19:24.360 --> 19:25.930
You haven't been frightened out of your wits, have you?

19:25.950 --> 19:26.510
My Lady.

19:32.270 --> 19:32.880
My Lady.

19:41.390 --> 19:41.860
My Lady.

19:42.000 --> 19:43.110
Ting... Tingzhou.

19:44.880 --> 19:46.640
I encountered a demon.

19:47.790 --> 19:48.270
A demon?

19:49.400 --> 19:50.270
Don't scare me.

19:51.880 --> 19:52.270
A demon.

19:53.830 --> 19:54.920
Where is the demon, My Lady?

19:57.110 --> 19:57.720
Where's Xuanye?

19:58.760 --> 19:59.790
Physician Jiu is outside.

20:01.400 --> 20:02.110
With Physician Jiu here,

20:02.590 --> 20:03.750
the demon surely won't come in.

20:04.880 --> 20:05.830
My Lady,

20:08.270 --> 20:09.240
please take the medicine first.

20:09.590 --> 20:10.350
I'll go find him.

20:15.200 --> 20:15.830
My Lady.

20:20.980 --> 20:21.530
My Lady.

20:27.510 --> 20:28.400
What's wrong, Banxia?

20:30.400 --> 20:31.030
Xuanye,

20:31.410 --> 20:32.350
there's a demon in the bowl.

20:32.370 --> 20:32.750
He...

20:32.790 --> 20:34.720
He's back. There's a demon in the bowl.

20:36.310 --> 20:36.750
Banxia.

20:36.960 --> 20:38.000
Banxia!

20:38.030 --> 20:38.640
There's a demon in the bowl!

20:38.640 --> 20:39.400
Banxia!

20:39.880 --> 20:40.590
Don't panic.

20:41.160 --> 20:41.830
Take it slow.

20:42.560 --> 20:43.640
What exactly happened?

20:44.750 --> 20:46.000
What do you mean, a demon in the bowl?

20:51.610 --> 20:53.410
That Mirror Demon has appeared again.

20:54.550 --> 20:56.160
He has bewitched many of the townsfolk,

20:56.350 --> 20:57.920
compelling them to offer me pears to eat.

20:58.730 --> 20:59.560
He cornered me

20:59.590 --> 21:00.550
in an alley,

21:00.960 --> 21:02.440
but fortunately, the mark you left on me

21:02.460 --> 21:03.350
took effect,

21:03.750 --> 21:04.830
allowing me to drive him away

21:05.360 --> 21:06.400
and narrowly escaping disaster.

21:08.030 --> 21:09.200
But just now,

21:10.000 --> 21:11.720
his shadow appeared in the bowl again.

21:12.440 --> 21:13.750
What should I do, Xuanye?

21:14.510 --> 21:15.830
It feels like he's targeting me.

21:18.070 --> 21:19.720
Sorry, I didn't think it through

21:20.160 --> 21:20.960
and ended up causing you trouble.

21:22.030 --> 21:22.830
He is a Mirror Demon,

21:23.420 --> 21:24.370
able to come and go freely in the world

21:24.400 --> 21:25.270
inside the mirror.

21:26.270 --> 21:27.440
But this world inside the mirror

21:27.640 --> 21:28.990
doesn't only refer to bronze mirrors,

21:29.550 --> 21:30.110
but anything

21:30.130 --> 21:31.170
that can reflect light

21:31.590 --> 21:32.720
and cast a shadow.

21:38.880 --> 21:39.510
Don't be afraid,

21:40.160 --> 21:41.480
I will guard outside tonight.

21:42.110 --> 21:43.510
If this demon dares to come,

21:43.690 --> 21:44.690
I won't let him get away.

21:48.270 --> 21:48.880
Tingzhou,

21:50.830 --> 21:51.440
everything in the room

21:51.440 --> 21:52.830
that can reflect a human shadow

21:53.000 --> 21:53.790
must be put away.

21:54.400 --> 21:55.960
Like vases, teacups,

21:56.230 --> 21:57.230
none of it can be left behind.

21:58.160 --> 21:59.030
Besides,

21:59.310 --> 22:01.000
water surfaces can also reflect shadows,

22:01.480 --> 22:02.480
so the usual

22:02.510 --> 22:03.350
medicinal soups and tea

22:03.590 --> 22:04.440
must all be kept away from light.

22:04.920 --> 22:06.480
Then how will my lady take her medicine?

22:07.350 --> 22:08.750
Use a gourd or a water pouch.

22:09.550 --> 22:10.000
Also,

22:10.480 --> 22:11.590
the windows must be covered,

22:11.990 --> 22:12.820
preferably with black cloth.

22:13.830 --> 22:14.310
Got it.

23:19.960 --> 23:20.590
Xuanye,

23:22.570 --> 23:23.680
are you asleep?

23:27.830 --> 23:28.750
Are you cold?

23:29.480 --> 23:30.410
Do you want

23:30.440 --> 23:31.510
an extra blanket

23:31.680 --> 23:33.000
or some thicker clothes?

23:34.960 --> 23:35.510
I'm not cold.

23:36.750 --> 23:37.680
Then, are you hungry?

23:37.920 --> 23:39.000
If you're hungry,

23:39.030 --> 23:39.790
I'll have Tingzhou

23:39.790 --> 23:40.830
bring some pastries.

23:42.200 --> 23:42.750
No need.

23:50.880 --> 23:52.510
If you're not tired,

23:53.070 --> 23:53.800
would you like to

23:53.830 --> 23:55.000
play a game of leaf cards?

23:55.880 --> 23:56.790
I'm really good at it.

23:57.240 --> 23:58.320
I've moved so many times.

23:58.340 --> 23:59.590
No one can ever beat me.

24:16.360 --> 24:17.550
Do you move often?

24:25.790 --> 24:26.510
Yes,

24:28.200 --> 24:30.200
you also know about my eye condition.

24:30.920 --> 24:32.640
It always causes trouble,

24:33.130 --> 24:33.930
so my father had no choice

24:33.960 --> 24:35.790
but to take me everywhere.

24:36.440 --> 24:38.000
I've been to many places,

24:39.160 --> 24:42.110
Nanyang, Yuanzhou, Huizhou,

24:42.240 --> 24:44.680
Lingquan, Baisai, Antu,

24:44.780 --> 24:45.680
Guangping.

24:53.000 --> 24:54.920
Anyway, it's everywhere.

24:58.000 --> 24:58.590
What about you?

25:01.000 --> 25:02.400
I'm not as well-traveled as you.

25:05.030 --> 25:06.640
So where have you been?

25:08.030 --> 25:10.070
Wherever the demons go, I go.

25:13.640 --> 25:15.270
That sounds pretty thrilling.

25:23.590 --> 25:24.070
By the way,

25:25.200 --> 25:25.920
about your eyes,

25:25.940 --> 25:27.580
have you always been able to see demons,

25:28.110 --> 25:29.440
or did it start at some point?

25:31.000 --> 25:32.160
I couldn't see them as a child.

25:35.270 --> 25:36.680
Did something happen to you?

25:39.510 --> 25:41.200
When I was little,

25:42.550 --> 25:43.880
I was kidnapped by a human trafficker,

25:45.880 --> 25:47.040
and he sold me to

25:47.070 --> 25:48.510
a dark and unknown place.

25:50.240 --> 25:51.550
I didn't know where it was.

25:52.400 --> 25:53.830
I only knew I was terrified.

25:55.920 --> 25:57.000
Later, when he was busy with

25:57.030 --> 25:57.750
settling the bills,

25:57.770 --> 25:58.960
I managed to escape,

26:00.880 --> 26:01.590
but I accidentally fell into

26:01.610 --> 26:02.830
a pool.

26:05.680 --> 26:07.160
I didn't die.

26:08.400 --> 26:09.340
Instead, I ended up in a

26:09.360 --> 26:10.580
very strange place.

26:12.030 --> 26:12.920
That place

26:13.880 --> 26:15.960
was full of things that were upside down,

26:17.350 --> 26:19.830
houses floating in the sky,

26:21.720 --> 26:23.570
statues as big as mountains.

26:25.200 --> 26:27.110
The whole place was shrouded in mist,

26:27.830 --> 26:29.000
completely deserted.

26:33.550 --> 26:35.230
Then I encountered a fierce beast,

26:35.440 --> 26:37.000
as big as a mountain.

26:39.000 --> 26:41.380
Luckily, a young man saved me,

26:42.430 --> 26:44.000
and I narrowly escaped death.

26:44.890 --> 26:46.130
He saved me,

26:48.580 --> 26:50.950
but that man also caught up.

26:52.270 --> 26:53.830
He had a gun and tried to kill me.

26:56.720 --> 26:58.200
To save me,

27:00.400 --> 27:01.380
he got injured

27:02.550 --> 27:04.240
and fell off the cliff with me.

27:06.680 --> 27:08.440
When I woke up again,

27:09.960 --> 27:11.590
it had already been three days.

27:14.110 --> 27:15.720
My parents found me,

27:18.850 --> 27:19.720
and I told them

27:19.750 --> 27:20.830
what had happened,

27:21.790 --> 27:22.920
but they didn't believe me.

27:24.110 --> 27:25.350
They couldn't convince me,

27:27.390 --> 27:28.520
so they went with me

27:28.550 --> 27:29.480
to find the young man.

27:30.550 --> 27:32.440
But not only did we fail to find him,

27:35.600 --> 27:37.190
even the misty place

27:37.220 --> 27:37.950
was gone.

27:39.720 --> 27:41.200
My parents told me

27:42.720 --> 27:43.960
it was all fake,

27:44.960 --> 27:46.110
just a dream.

27:47.830 --> 27:49.550
I had thought the same before.

27:55.650 --> 27:57.140
Since then,

27:58.830 --> 28:00.240
I've been able to see demons.

28:01.850 --> 28:03.530
They said I was sick,

28:05.270 --> 28:06.350
and at first,

28:06.370 --> 28:08.090
I was half-believing it too,

28:09.960 --> 28:10.640
until

28:17.960 --> 28:18.960
I met you.

28:28.270 --> 28:28.830
Xuanye.

28:32.790 --> 28:33.830
Do you think

28:36.830 --> 28:37.880
my dream was real?

28:39.960 --> 28:40.800
Was there really

28:40.830 --> 28:42.480
such a misty place,

28:44.080 --> 28:45.880
and did a young man really save me?

29:11.480 --> 29:12.070
Xuanye.

29:19.590 --> 29:20.550
Are you asleep?

29:24.030 --> 29:24.590
I'm here.

29:29.310 --> 29:30.270
So do you think

29:31.480 --> 29:32.720
my dream was real?

29:34.200 --> 29:34.750
I don't know.

29:44.440 --> 29:45.310
But it's very possible.

29:49.480 --> 29:50.030
Really?

29:51.810 --> 29:52.480
As for your eyes,

29:52.510 --> 29:53.590
if they weren't something you were born with,

29:54.290 --> 29:55.130
then something

29:55.160 --> 29:55.830
must have happened

29:56.480 --> 29:57.200
to give you the ability

29:57.200 --> 29:58.790
to see the true form of demons.

29:59.790 --> 30:01.160
That's not an ordinary ability.

30:05.490 --> 30:06.770
What's so extraordinary about it?

30:07.640 --> 30:08.990
You can see them too, can't you?

30:11.270 --> 30:12.110
I'm different.

30:12.720 --> 30:13.440
I can't see them.

30:13.790 --> 30:14.790
I can only feel them.

30:15.510 --> 30:16.720
If I want to see demons,

30:17.180 --> 30:18.480
I still need to use the hypostasis water.

30:25.030 --> 30:26.350
Alright, go to sleep now.

30:31.750 --> 30:32.960
I'm not sleepy.

30:36.750 --> 30:37.440
How about

30:38.320 --> 30:39.930
you tell me

30:39.960 --> 30:40.680
about your childhood?

30:43.310 --> 30:43.960
I don't want to talk about it.

31:02.270 --> 31:03.000
Actually,

31:05.500 --> 31:07.360
I'm just a little scared

31:07.390 --> 31:09.020
and want to talk to someone.

31:19.680 --> 31:20.270
Xuanye.

31:26.240 --> 31:27.750
I really can't sleep.

31:32.680 --> 31:34.350
Let me teach you a mantra.

31:35.030 --> 31:36.210
My father taught it to me.

31:36.920 --> 31:38.580
He said to recite it whenever you're afraid,

31:39.000 --> 31:40.300
and it will calm your mind

31:40.680 --> 31:41.400
and make you fearless.

31:42.720 --> 31:43.270
Alright.

32:05.920 --> 32:07.800
May the heart remain in timeless serenity.

32:09.630 --> 32:11.630
May the heart remain in timeless serenity.

32:12.680 --> 32:14.750
Like clouds drifting, like rivers flowing.

32:16.310 --> 32:18.590
Like clouds drifting, like rivers flowing.

32:19.750 --> 32:22.210
Face all without turning away.

32:23.400 --> 32:26.000
Face all without turning away.

32:27.160 --> 32:29.200
In peace, release desires that cloud the mind.

32:29.750 --> 32:31.640
For all things rise and fall, unite and part like the ebbing tide.

32:32.000 --> 32:34.240
In peace, release desires that cloud the mind.

32:36.030 --> 32:37.680
For all things rise and fall, unite and part like the ebbing tide.

32:46.960 --> 32:48.160
May the heart remain in timeless serenity.

32:52.280 --> 32:53.480
May the heart remain in timeless serenity.

32:57.370 --> 32:58.570
May the heart remain in timeless serenity.

33:00.240 --> 33:00.720
Xuanye,

33:00.990 --> 33:02.310
your mantra isn't powerful at all.

33:02.830 --> 33:03.730
When did you get here?

33:03.960 --> 33:04.760
I've been here for a while.

33:04.830 --> 33:05.350
You didn't call me,

33:05.350 --> 33:06.240
so I came out by myself.

33:10.800 --> 33:11.990
May the heart remain in timeless serenity.

33:12.720 --> 33:13.110
Serenity.

33:14.400 --> 33:14.720
Serenity.

33:16.270 --> 33:17.620
May the heart remain in timeless serenity.

33:20.200 --> 33:20.730
Serenity.

33:21.450 --> 33:21.920
Serenity.

33:50.310 --> 33:51.330
Who are you?

33:51.680 --> 33:52.720
Who let you in?

33:53.000 --> 33:53.830
We're here on official business.

33:53.960 --> 33:55.160
Get out! How dare you

33:55.750 --> 33:56.590
barge in like this?

34:00.200 --> 34:02.300
You can't just barge in like that.

34:02.330 --> 34:02.850
Xuanye.

34:05.030 --> 34:05.920
Go find Wen Jian.

34:09.400 --> 34:10.230
Physician Jiu.

34:11.320 --> 34:12.510
What brings you here, Chief Constable Chu?

34:13.920 --> 34:14.840
Three days ago,

34:15.090 --> 34:16.699
a dancer named Tian Rui from Yunmen Dance Troupe

34:16.719 --> 34:17.620
died in Yanlai Restaurant.

34:18.110 --> 34:19.020
The cause of death is unknown,

34:19.110 --> 34:20.480
and the murderer has not been caught yet.

34:20.920 --> 34:21.699
But her body

34:21.730 --> 34:22.630
was stolen.

34:24.000 --> 34:24.590
After investigation,

34:25.000 --> 34:26.230
it was discovered that the person who stole her body

34:27.000 --> 34:28.889
was you, Jiu Xuanye.

34:33.880 --> 34:34.550
Physician Jiu,

34:35.320 --> 34:36.440
please come with us.

34:37.880 --> 34:39.110
What happened?

34:40.150 --> 34:40.840
Xuanye?

34:41.920 --> 34:42.550
Tingzhou?

34:44.630 --> 34:45.360
Who's in there?

34:47.000 --> 34:48.750
It's none of your business.

34:57.190 --> 34:58.320
I'm going out for a while.

34:58.590 --> 34:59.320
I'll be back soon.

34:59.880 --> 35:01.100
What's going on?

35:02.150 --> 35:03.000
Is it serious?

35:04.480 --> 35:05.000
It's not a big deal.

35:06.280 --> 35:07.110
It will just

35:07.580 --> 35:08.990
take some time.

35:12.400 --> 35:13.400
I'll set up a formation using medicinal powder

35:13.590 --> 35:14.760
and create a barrier around your room

35:14.990 --> 35:16.150
so that he won't dare approach.

35:16.880 --> 35:18.110
As long as you stay inside,

35:18.200 --> 35:19.120
you'll be safe.

35:19.960 --> 35:20.510
Remember,

35:20.960 --> 35:21.590
don't go outside.

35:24.000 --> 35:24.710
Don't worry,

35:25.320 --> 35:26.440
I won't wander off.

35:27.550 --> 35:28.110
Wait for me to return.

35:31.590 --> 35:32.430
Can we go now?

36:09.920 --> 36:11.250
All this hocus-pocus.

36:31.920 --> 36:32.400
Let's go.

36:45.840 --> 36:46.280
Tingzhou,

36:46.750 --> 36:47.720
what's wrong?

36:47.780 --> 36:49.170
Where did Xuanye go?

36:49.230 --> 36:50.510
My Lady, don't worry.

36:50.920 --> 36:51.920
Physician Jiu will be fine.

36:52.230 --> 36:53.810
The constable mentioned

36:53.840 --> 36:54.630
they're investigating a case

36:54.840 --> 36:55.840
and need to ask a few questions.

36:56.030 --> 36:57.070
He'll return shortly.

36:57.760 --> 36:58.280
Really?

36:58.960 --> 36:59.360
Really.

37:00.190 --> 37:01.230
I bought some steamed buns.

37:01.600 --> 37:02.500
You must be starving.

37:02.670 --> 37:03.190
Have some.

37:13.590 --> 37:14.840
My Lady, water.

37:41.720 --> 37:45.840
[Guangping Government]

37:43.110 --> 37:43.940
Chief Constable Chu,

37:44.540 --> 37:45.990
you've been questioning me for half a day.

37:46.280 --> 37:47.630
If you don't have any evidence,

37:48.110 --> 37:49.070
maybe you should just let me go.

37:50.000 --> 37:50.710
Evidence

37:51.310 --> 37:52.020
will be here soon.

37:53.880 --> 37:54.440
Is that so?

37:57.070 --> 37:57.810
I've already sent people

37:57.840 --> 37:59.280
to search your Ganshan Clinic.

38:00.190 --> 38:01.350
Once they find the corpse,

38:02.480 --> 38:03.440
I'll be able to convict you.

38:03.880 --> 38:05.550
What right do you have to search my house?

38:07.000 --> 38:08.460
Because I'm the Chief Constable,

38:09.110 --> 38:09.880
and you're a bandit.

38:12.710 --> 38:13.480
Trying to leave?

38:14.280 --> 38:15.070
Stop him!

38:16.550 --> 38:17.370
You tried to leave the government office

38:17.400 --> 38:18.310
without my permission.

38:18.670 --> 38:19.630
Is there no law anymore?

38:20.880 --> 38:21.630
Youhuang.

38:22.760 --> 38:23.360
What's wrong?

39:06.120 --> 39:06.930
Tingzhou.

39:19.410 --> 39:20.080
Tingzhou.

39:25.550 --> 39:26.190
Tingzhou.

39:27.190 --> 39:27.800
Tingzhou.

39:38.190 --> 39:38.840
Tingzhou.

39:39.440 --> 39:40.570
Wake up, Tingzhou.

39:52.150 --> 39:53.190
I'll set up a formation using medicinal powder

39:53.440 --> 39:54.440
and create a barrier around your room

39:54.760 --> 39:55.840
so that he won't dare approach.

39:56.670 --> 39:57.800
As long as you stay inside,

39:58.000 --> 39:58.760
you'll be safe.

39:59.590 --> 40:00.150
Remember,

40:00.710 --> 40:01.360
don't go outside.

40:58.510 --> 40:59.000
Tingzhou.

40:59.440 --> 41:00.510
Tingzhou, wake up quickly.

41:01.030 --> 41:01.800
Wake up, please.

41:20.320 --> 41:21.230
I'm not scared.

41:23.000 --> 41:23.840
I'm not scared.

41:25.240 --> 41:26.320
I'm not scared.

41:31.620 --> 41:33.420
May the heart remain in timeless serenity.

41:34.190 --> 41:36.000
Like clouds drifting, like rivers flowing.

41:36.500 --> 41:37.630
Face all

41:38.840 --> 41:39.960
without turning away.

41:41.000 --> 41:43.000
In peace, release desires that cloud the mind.

41:43.020 --> 41:44.460
For all things rise and fall, unite and part like the ebbing tide.

43:11.800 --> 43:13.470
Come out! I'm not afraid of you.
